{"games":[{"id":8473958692,"name":"The Trials [PHASE 0]","desc":"Welcome, Participant! \nCompete against other participants in a lethal facility designed to kill all but one. It's your choice to decide whether or not to participate, but once you do, the choice is no longer yours. The Trials is a thrilling adventure game that requires some wit and skill to succeed. \n\nI made The Trials (BETA) in 2019 and have decided to bring it back for a full series! The beta was child's play, Phase 1 is only the beginning. Join the group to stay in the loop with updates! \n\n**WANT TO BECOME A VALID PARTICIPANT?** \n~Join ZELZ to get the Valid Participant name tag! Ranks will have more relevance to the game in the future features~","path":"/game/8473958692-the-trials","slug":"8473958692-the-trials","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ddf85312023575845366fad180debf340cbd2506c4421b7cbca72b6f172bcb3a.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2ae8c64b8064da8550717e9d29961fb5/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":9,"visitor":27116462,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-08-23T02:34:55.943Z","creator":{"name":"ZELZ","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":1581113210,"name":"Area 47: Roleplay","desc":"SCP - Area 47: Roleplay Welcome to Armed SCP Containment Area 47, a Role-Playing game for all things SCP!\n\nThis game is based on the SCP genre, and is a facility containing the most dangerous SCPs. The SCP Foundation is a multi-government collaboration to protect humanity. Contained in the facility are SCP Creatures of horror, SCP Monsters that could destroy the world if they ever escape. \n\nIn this SCP Site Roleplay, you can play as all kinds of roles like Class - D, Scientist, Mobile Task Force, Security Department, and many more! Through playing these various roles, level up your keycard clearance in the Foundation, and assist in creating the most secure SCP Facility to exist.\n\nWant to learn more about the Foundation, and get some special in-game perks? Join our group! https://www.roblox.com/groups/2760782/SCPF\n\nGame Rules: https://devforum.roblox.com/t/3551820","path":"/game/1581113210-area-47-roleplay","slug":"1581113210-area-47-roleplay","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ca36b48dfb810bf90d452bbba832832b16da0a9476696828c904ba5d1801d9cb.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-503bf5bf94fd92b8a5e1d440fb8cab45/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":9,"visitor":66161148,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-03-21T22:57:51.064Z","creator":{"name":"Special Containment Procedures Foundation [SCPF]","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6284881984,"name":"[GEAR 5 UPDATE] Anime Mania","desc":"","path":"/game/6284881984-anime-mania","slug":"6284881984-anime-mania","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a8e9b88e22e264da52ed91e6ca3a1b58b767489ceafb53e743d49906045bc6db.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e3214c9c60ab4f666d2ad9a75d9cf432/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":9,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-04-30T22:27:24.863Z","creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":164430409,"name":"ALONE IN A DARK HOUSE [Horror] [VR] [Voice]","desc":"Available on XBOX, Mobile, and VR.\n\nA story of an investigator who's told to find a runaway murderer. The investigator finds themselves running into a paranormal anomaly. Solve the mystery while surviving the anomaly.\n\nFor the absolute best first playthrough experience, it is highly recommended to play alone, in the dark, and with headphones on.\n\nTags: Horror, Scary, Creepy, Multiplayer, Puzzle, Story, VR, Mobile","path":"/game/164430409-alone-in-a-dark-house","slug":"164430409-alone-in-a-dark-house","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7abedc83a9d84479ce9fbe47f8e7056a11b3c49d3be2e2a55621bdab345203a0.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-88a22f2fee597b3996bbcdf8f542257